With geom_raster() on a different data set I had the exact same problem trying to change the color scale to anything but the default (blues) using scale_fill_brewer(). For example, specifying any of these two has no effect:

scale_color_brewer(type = "seq", palette = 3)
or
scale_color_brewer(type = "div", palette = "Spectral")

But I was able to get around using scale_fill_gradientn() or scale_fill_gradient().

